        "q1": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is home builder marketing?",
            "answer": "Home builder marketing is the mix of digital marketing, sales and visual work that brings buyers to new construction: the website and listings, social media, real estate agents, open houses and model homes. What sets it apart is timing. Many new homes are marketed before they exist, so photorealistic renderings and floor plans carry the marketing efforts until construction is complete."
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the best marketing for a home builder or construction company?",
            "answer": "There is no single channel. Effective home builder marketing usually combines a website that answers buyer questions, local search visibility, social media, relationships with real estate agents and strong visuals. For homes that aren't built yet, the visuals are the constraint: photorealistic 3D renderings let every other channel start before construction does."
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is a 3D marketing strategy?",
            "answer": "A 3D marketing strategy uses 3D renderings, 3D floor plans and virtual tours to market a property before or alongside photography. For a home builder it means launching pre-sales from plans, with renders on the website and listings, in brochures, on site hoardings and in social media campaigns."
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How much do 3D renderings cost?",
            "answer": "At Bella, photoreal 3D renders start at {price:3d-rendering} per finished image (one room or building from one camera angle), with revisions and 4K print-ready delivery included and volume discounts up to 20%. Exterior streetscapes, aerials and multi-building views cost more; the full price table is on our 3D architectural rendering services page."
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can ChatGPT or artificial intelligence create renderings?",
            "answer": "AI image tools, including ChatGPT, can generate a picture of a house in seconds, but they don't work from your dimensioned plans, so walls, windows and rooflines often drift from the real design. That is a problem when you are marketing a home you will actually build. Bella's renders are modelled by human 3D artists from your drawings, never generated by AI."
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the best rendering software for home design?",
            "answer": "Designers commonly use SketchUp, Revit or Autodesk 3ds Max to model a home, a rendering engine to produce the image, and Photoshop to finish it. If your goal is marketing homes rather than designing them, you don't need rendering software at all: send your plans to a rendering studio and get finished, photorealistic images back."
          }
        },
        "q7": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do 3D renderings help home builders sell?",
            "answer": "They let marketing start before construction starts. Listings, ads and social posts go live with photorealistic images of the finished home, so you collect interest and pre-sales from the moment the plans are final. Buyers can compare design options and finishes side by side, and because buyers, your sales team and your trades all sign off on the same image, renders can reduce the misunderstandings that turn into change orders."
          }
        },
        "q8": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can a home builder get more leads?",
            "answer": "Make the homes easy to find and easy to picture. Keep a website page for every community and floor plan, a current Google Business Profile for local search, and listings with photorealistic images. Run targeted ads to the buyers you build for, answer inquiries quickly, collect reviews, and publish helpful content that answers buyer questions rather than only promoting."
          }
        },
