          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Should I hire freelance designers or a rendering studio?",
            "answer": "Freelance designers can cost less per image, but quality, turnaround and revision policy vary from person to person. A studio gives you one price list, a consistent team and a defined revision process. Either way, check the portfolio for projects like yours and confirm you get full usage rights to the images."
          }
        }
